{"id":"n83164-1-7","stage":3,"title":"별 · 特别的","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83164-1-7-1","ko":"승규가 왜 저렇게 화가 났어?","zh":"承奎怎么那么生气啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화가","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났어?","meaning":"发火（화이/가 나다）","explanation":"나다：发火（화이/가 나다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发火（화이/가 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发火（화이/가 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/666ee97c48d84ebbfea6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83164-1-7-2","ko":"나는 별 뜻 없이 농담을 했는데 승규가 오해를 한 것 같아.","zh":"我并没有别的意思，只是开个玩笑，但承奎好像误会了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별","meaning":"特别的","explanation":"별：特别的","readings":[{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83164","senseId":"1","lemma":"별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜻","meaning":"意，意思","explanation":"뜻：意，意思","readings":[{"term":"뜻","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43785","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜻","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"9","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"농담을","meaning":"笑话，戏言，闹着玩儿","explanation":"농담：笑话，戏言，闹着玩儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"농담","audio":"/audio/9683003985125a24b9d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43805","senseId":"1","lemma":"농담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했는데","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"오해를","meaning":"误解，误会","explanation":"오해：误解，误会；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"오해","audio":"/audio/a317fe4511680982e2e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22033","senseId":"1","lemma":"오해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ae3fc36d3a72017f","term":"별","zh":"特别的","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3","entryId":"83164","definition":"不同一般的，特殊或奇怪的。","pronunciation":["별"]},{"id":"883d841ce6a33cf7","term":"뜻","zh":"意，意思","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3","entryId":"43785","definition":"语言、文字或行为所表达的内容。","pronunciation":["뜯"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"理由或可能性等不成立地。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"9683003985125a24","term":"농담","zh":"笑话，戏言，闹着玩儿","audio":"/audio/9683003985125a24b9d3.mp3","entryId":"43805","definition":"开别人玩笑的话或搞笑的话。","pronunciation":["농ː담"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a317fe4511680982","term":"오해","zh":"误解，误会","audio":"/audio/a317fe4511680982e2e2.mp3","entryId":"22033","definition":"错误地了解或解释某个东西。","pronunciation":["오ː해"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/au